apshot 已定义&#10;Safe Build 真执行仍阻断&#10;可进入受控阶段实现" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="510" y="130" width="390" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="exit" value="允许进入的下一步&#10;controlled implementation&#10;schema validation + focused tests&#10;不批准连续自动化实现" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="950" y="130" width="330" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="nogo1" value="No-Go：证据替代&#10;docs/drawio/HTML/mock/sample 不得替代真实 OCR/source/UI/build evidence" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="380" width="300" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="nogo2" value="No-Go：状态误判&#10;needs_review / unavailable / blocker / failed 不计 accepted&#10;non-waivable 不可豁免" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="380" width="300" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="nogo3" value="No-Go：执行安全&#10;无 approval 或无 managed sandbox 不执行外部命令&#10;不得写原项目目录" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="380" width="320" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="green" value="真正全绿条件&#10;focused tests +真实 E2E + schema validation + PRD/spec review + false-green audit + protected file check + final gate 无高风险未解释" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x